<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>GuideTrack | Data Privacy NDA</title>
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700&family=Playfair+Display:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/style.css">
</head>
<body>
  <nav class="nda-nav">
    <span class="brand">
      <span class="brand-name">Guide<em>Track</em></span>
      <span class="brand-sub">Guidance Management System • UPHS-DALTA Calamba</span>
    </span>
    <form method="POST" action="/logout">
      <button type="submit" class="btn subtle">Sign out</button>
    </form>
  </nav>

  <main class="container container-narrow">
    <section class="card nda-card">
      <div class="nda-head">
        <p class="kicker">Confidentiality &amp; Consent</p>
        <h1>GuideTrack | Data Privacy NDA</h1>
        <p class="muted">
          Before you can access the appointment portal, please review the Non-Disclosure Agreement and
          Data Privacy Notice below. This page informs users of their rights and responsibilities
          regarding the collection, processing, and protection of personal information within the system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="nda-section">
        <h2>Compliance</h2>
        <p>
          The Guidance Office of the University of Perpetual Help System DALTA – Calamba Campus adheres
          to the provisions of the <strong>Data Privacy Act of 2012 (Republic Act No. 10173)</strong>.
          The GuideTrack system is committed to protecting the personal information of all users in
          accordance with national data privacy regulations and university policies.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="nda-section">
        <h2>Confidentiality</h2>
        <p>
          All consultation sessions, personal concerns, and records submitted through the GuideTrack
          system are treated as <strong>strictly confidential</strong>. Such information can only be
          accessed by authorized guidance personnel and will be used solely for academic, guidance, and
          research purposes. Access is restricted to protect sensitive student information and support
          the ethical handling of counseling records.
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="nda-section">
        <h2>Consent</h2>
        <p>
          By agreeing to these terms, you acknowledge that the information you provide is accurate and
          true, and you consent to the <strong>secure digital processing of your records</strong> within
          the GuideTrack system. You further agree not to disclose any confidential information obtained
          through the system.
        </p>
      </div>

      <form method="POST" action="/nda" class="nda-form">
        <label class="nda-check">
          <input type="checkbox" name="agree" value="1" id="agree-check">
          <span>I have read, understood, and accepted the terms and conditions presented in this
            Non-Disclosure Agreement and Data Privacy Notice.</span>
        </label>

        <button type="submit" id="proceed-btn" class="btn primary" disabled>Proceed to Appointment Portal</button>
      </form>
    </section>
  </main>

  <%- include('partials/footer', { user }) %>

  <script>
    (function () {
      var check = document.getElementById('agree-check');
      var btn = document.getElementById('proceed-btn');
      check.addEventListener('change', function () {
        btn.disabled = !check.checked;
      });
    })();
  </script>
</body>
</html>